                (2, "Browse parts by category or search for specific items."),
                (3, "Add parts to your build—adjust quantities as needed."),
                (4, "Your running total updates in the sidebar as you add items."),
                (5, "Select your motorcycle model to ensure compatibility."),
                (6, "Tap \"Submit Build\" to send your request to the shop."),
